{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f056cd232b837496e76fe35679090619b641314ac6cc2f3f84d3780438539e1", "ja": "（劇場を移動中、瑞希が勉強をしているのを見かけた。\n随分と真剣な表情だな……）", "zh": "（在剧场里走动时，看到瑞希正在学习。\n表情真是相当认真啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d3f67f2b4041ae36f58b20cf495850286f1dcef241b408d7b9c6f8a549967316", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れさま。\n頑張ってるな、学校の宿題か？", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦了。\n很努力嘛，这是学校的作业吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "2021a830209efc68e091c80cc56ec2ad7ba8adaf0472fe394849843de06b2855", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nいえ。この問題集は、宿題ではありません。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n不是。这本习题集不是作业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "102c09eb59a50f2b2a20e9bf10ce32539d9517e6ecf5b0a631102a1f65e75ad4", "ja": "宿題じゃない？\n……あれ、本当だ。中学生用の問題集じゃないか。", "zh": "不是作业？\n……咦，还真是。这不是初中生的习题集吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "c0df176ee10c4f03f8bd557af6d0a4fde80fc56e7cadfaadccbc2176d96a95bf", "ja": "望月さんの勉強を見る約束をしたので、\n復習していました。……なかなかの難問ぞろい、だぞ。", "zh": "我和望月同学约好了要帮她辅导功课，所以在复习呢。……里面有不少难题，哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1bafb26a577891fc505788ea24254c310fe4b8d8239289f508505158afd82b09", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事か。けど、そんなに難しいか？\n瑞希なら中学校の数学くらい、楽勝かと思ったよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。不过，有那么难吗？\n我还以为对瑞希来说，中学数学应该轻轻松松就能搞定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "cfd88d13355a0fd4d493b75eb1f9110e14c88ad5c0621078c3dcbcf08aaecc9c", "ja": "いえ、{$P$}。\nそんなことはありません。……たとえばこの問題。", "zh": "不是的，{$P$}。\n没那回事。……比如这道题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "66accd5ae420c3a1ea1e28437481f680f72cd251d7d645eb7499e3ff2b4a2d00", "ja": "「たかしくんが、xメートルあたりy円のリボンを\n7メートル分買う時の代金を式に表せ」とあります。", "zh": "题目是这样写的：“小高要买每x米y日元的丝带，购买7米所需的费用用式子表示。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3ac6f37125d8b1d2546bfb3dcac07102ef7000c5dba4a3b3b7d13b994ddc17f4", "ja": "よくある代入の問題だな。\nこの問題が、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "是很常见的代入题呢。\n这道题怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "e2019700ccc5e1fab7b3d860f3f3d9f56a6aa3516adda5791dbf4be3df87efb3", "ja": "はい。……たかしくんは、なぜ\nリボンを買っているのでしょうか。", "zh": "是的……Takashi为什么会在买彩带呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "a7e73007cb2752b78c0ba49f1c8bcaea15d17db6e105bf433021154d332a5552", "ja": "誰かへのプレゼントなら、7メートルは長すぎます。\n工作用か、手芸か……謎は深まるばかり。", "zh": "如果是要送给谁的礼物，7米未免太长了。\n是用来做手工，还是缝纫……谜团越来越深了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0de176422d20040eb5fb59e1d1c74b3e7da47b0a2a024be49a200a846b170de1", "ja": "なるほど。問題自体に疑問を持ったって事か……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，你开始怀疑起题目本身了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "855fee454808b51d429992261e4d9034d2b8527bb4b845860442ae0d6c5eaf0b", "ja": "確かに数学って、不思議な問題が多いかもしれないな。\nやたら複雑な切り方をするケーキとか……。", "zh": "确实，数学里有很多奇怪的题目。\n比如把蛋糕切成各种复杂形状之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "55192acad857e8956c0b912098a6dfcbb9303510c7fa17a26f09118756037834", "ja": "一緒に帰らない友達も、気になります。\n……そして何よりも気になるのが、点P。", "zh": "不和我一起回去的朋友，也让我很在意。\n……而最让我在意的，还是点P。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9d66bf5bae2031b6c29e0f8732ede814f1106bb9cc07e6e7b3439fc1a955f387", "ja": "点P？", "zh": "点P？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "309a8133e2ea94df24bd82576aed47b56601dbb05be0f9cd16f680349a64caa2", "ja": "はい。ある時はAB間を等速で動き、またある時は、\n点Mとつながることもある……あの点Pです。", "zh": "是的。有时会在AB之间匀速移动，有时又会和点M连在一起……就是那个点P。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "38baf41a8d58ee32b8c24a19306b7ef9faca464db4b32bf065cd2a8ca0508998", "ja": "いったい点Pは何を考えているのでしょう。\n点Mのことをどう思っているのか。……気になるぞ。", "zh": "点P到底在想些什么呢。\n它又是怎么看待点M的呢。……真令人好奇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9f777e9c2f37b1b0d9dad0b18d57764868411c9067b72a24bdcfeabd36f7ce31", "ja": "いや、俺に聞かれてもわからないけど……\nつながってるくらいだし、友達とか、仲間とか……？", "zh": "不，就算问我也不知道啊……既然都联系着，算是朋友、伙伴之类的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "b9fba4d590b5296bac69d0a037bd213334fa3d947f3d3e4280a6ab3ed03c0aa8", "ja": "友達、ですか。それはうれしいような、\nどこか物足りないような。……複雑。", "zh": "朋友吗？感觉像是高兴，又觉得有点不够……真复杂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "c9fac11891cf6691ef9facea286b6ce88dee148fe668fa237930fe58a429912b", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこの問題は、持ち帰って宿題にしたいと思います。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我想把这个问题带回去当作作业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0213_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "0e6d7a7570a93b7d1a2f4a3c3886fb910f09d51c3fa7746ea2097f50a56b2019", "ja": "問題を解いていたはずが、逆に増えてしまいました。\nですが、必ず解いてみせます。……えいえい、おう。", "zh": "本想解决问题，结果反而变多了。\n但是，我一定会解开的。……加油，噢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
